OL,3,GNEWSA'Perimenopause cost me my job and
OL,4,Afamily life'
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor three years, Sally Williams
OL,7,Fstruggled to understand what was
OL,8,Fhappening to her as her mental health
OL,9,Fdeteriorated and her life fell apart,
OL,10,Fspending almost 11 months in hospital
OL,11,Facross eight admissions.
OL,13,FShe left her finance job, was separated
OL,14,Ffrom her teenage son and found herself
OL,15,Ffighting for her life, unaware her
OL,16,Fsymptoms could be linked to
OL,17,Fperimenopause.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,357,350,200,160,0,100
