OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F356A1791039330
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSA'Perimenopause cost me my job and
OL,4,Afamily life'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"No one joined the dots," Williams
OL,7,Fsaid. "It was only me... I joined the
OL,8,Fdots and it was transformational to
OL,9,Fstart hormone replacement therapy and
OL,10,Fliterally come back to life."
OL,12,FWilliams, who initially self-diagnosed,
OL,13,Fwants other women to be aware of
OL,14,Fperimenopause, the years leading up to
OL,15,Fmenopause, which she described as the
OL,16,F"danger zone".
